{
  "scope": "Frozen research selector on archived English source pools. Pools cover the small-catalog cohort, the fresh dual-preview cohort and the previously auditioned holdout runs for Forget Me Not, Horropedia, Vertin and Isolde. This measures selection sensitivity. Human listening is recorded separately.",
  "method": "Hold each original fit pool, peer ranking, acoustic thresholds, fallback and tie order fixed. Transcribe every source that passes the acoustic gates, including those eliminated by game punctuation. Compare the original catalog-text decision with ASR punctuation alone, then ASR punctuation plus a material word-discrepancy veto for steady candidates. All three arms retain the same original fallback when no steady candidate qualifies. The veto was specified before examining these results.",
